// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - DestroyOrNotDestroyThatIsTheQuestionClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P213991650" "Scent of Fixadine"
// tDetailString :
"P1340938902" "You're easily able to smell when even the smallest amount of Fixadine is in the air - a helpful trait to have when dealing with Destroyers. You gained this ability after being exposed to a large amount of Fixadine in an experience you call...<br><br><b><color paragon>Destroy or Not Destroy, That is the Question</color></b><br><br>You and Jack Hammer were working together to find Mr. Fixadine and the source of the drug in Nova. Mr. Fixadine 'informed' you of the location where he gets all of his supplies. You went in ahead of the Resistance, only to discover that the PPD were guarding the stash! You plowed through the PPD and defeated a guard appointed by Praetor White himself.<br><br>Jack Hammer and the Resistance arrived to help confiscate the supplies of Fixadine, but it was at this moment that a choice was presented. You could help Jack Hammer bring this Fixadine back... or you could turn to give the Fixadine right back to the Loyalists, in return for a <i>very</i> high position in the party, not to mention other various rewards. The choice was up to you - did you choose to aid the Resistance in creating their own army of soldiers addicted to Fixadine, or aid the Loyalists to increase your own wealth and power?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4109394585" "Huh, what do we have here?<br><br>{HeroName}, standin' around my stash of Fixadine, with a buncha Resistance and PPD knocked outta your way.<br><br>I gotta say, I'm impressed. But I gotta wonder, what do you plan on doin' now that <i>I'm</i> here?"
// Answer Text :
"P249475256" "I plan on making a deal with you."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1898460908" "A deal huh?<br><br><color orange>Praetor White barks out a laugh.</color><br><br>You really got a lotta guts, {HeroName}, I'll give you that.<br><br>Alright then, what's your deal?"
// Answer Text :
"P2658229077" "It seems to me that you want this place protected, right?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1116475122" "That's what I was goin' for, 'till you came stompin' around here."
// Answer Text :
"P1990780491" "Right. So it seems like you need someone -better- to be in charge of this."
// Page Better Text :
"P3142446647" "What? Like you? You want a piece of this pie?"
// Answer Text :
"P2982292583" "Not too much. What I want is power, White. I think we can work out a deal."
// Page Power Text :
"P3813138529" "Power huh? And what's stopping me from just punching your face off here and now?"
// Answer Text :
"P1911435727" "Because you need someone like me around to make your men better."
// Page BoysBetter Text :
"P1143840032" "Hrmph.<br><br>As much as I wanna grab your face and stomp it in the ground, you got a point. I wish all those pansies in the PPD were like you, {HeroName}.<br><br>You got the guts to look me in the eye and tell me what you want, you got the <i>power</i> to go take what you want.<br><br>It's why I have this whole operation here in the first place - those Destroyers forced the PPD to try to be better. Or, if they weren't, I got myself some new soldiers in the form of the Destroyers. Either way, it's a win-win.<br><br>But now... looks like you come walkin' along and change that. Havin' someone like you around is gonna change things. Maybe those pansies in the PPD will finally start getting tougher, and <i>maybe</i> my Powers Division will start to actually throw their weight around."
// Answer Text :
"P233905652" "So, do we have a deal? I keep this secret, you give me a high position in the Loyalists."
// Page Deal Text :
"P2991283782" "We got ourselves a deal, {HeroName}.<br><br>I could use someone like you around. Maybe you ain't out to help us, but it'll make my boys in the Powers Division stronger. And if you take 'em out, well, then it just means that I'll get myself some new competition one day.<br><br>I'll give the word to folks within the Loyalists that you proved yourself to me. You want something from us, you got it.<br><br>Just as long as this whole little deal here? It stays between us."
// Answer Text :
"P371582525" "Good doing business with you, Praetor White."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4016895157" "We got ourselves a big lead, {HeroName}.<br><br>Bad news is, all the guys I sent out to find the main source of this stuff are dead.<br><br>Good news is one of them gave me a report of where they found the main stash. They didn't give me any numbers or whatever about what they were facing, which is why it's gonna have to be <i>you</i> that goes down there first to secure the situation.<br><br>I know you're not someone who minds jumping in and getting their hands dirty, so this last bit should be a piece of cake for you, yeah?<br><br><color yellow>This arc is a SINGLE PLAYER MORAL CHOICE story arc. You will not be able to have other people on your team assist you with this story arc.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P4086069132" "I'll handle it."
// SendOffString :
"P1346149987" "Great! Once you get down to the place, we'll follow in. I get a feeling there's gonna be a LOT of Fixadine down there... we're gonna have to set ourselves up some sorta system to move everything over here. But first, we'll focus on actually getting to the Fixadine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1759046274" "Secure the Fixadine Stash (Single Player)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P942753690" "We're all ready on our end here, {HeroName}, you just gvie the word."
// TaskTitle :
"P2820496019" "<color deepskyblue>"Destroy or Not Destroy, That is the Question"</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1772445940" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Skeleton in the Closet</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
