// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Caption :
"P2079396593" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 d=4 t=4><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>You've managed to uncover the secret behind the Destroyers..."
// 4 Caption :
"P4213922502" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 d=4 t=4><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>All this time, Praetor White has been giving them the Fixodine!"
// 4 Caption :
"P3438124625" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 d=4 t=4><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>With this discovery, Jack Hammer and the other members of the Resistance rush in to see this for themselves..."
// 4 Caption :
"P3209128240" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=4 t=4><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>But what would happen..."
// 3 Caption :
"P729077" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5 t=5><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>...if giving this back over to the Loyalists would be more lucrative?"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P1974215365" "<em VillainLaugh t=3 d=3>Awh man {HeroName}, we hit the JACKPOT! Check all of this out!"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P669363223" "<em Plot t=3 d=3>We got enough Fixadine here to keep an entire army of Destroyers under our thumb!"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P579304642" "<em Rooting t=3 d=3>We can pump a ton of this into our soldiers, make 'em tougher, stronger than ever!"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3831863021" "<em t=3 d=3>We just need your help in getting this stuff outta here and into our own place!"
// LeftText :
"P824448872" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Steal the Fixadine</color></scale><br>Help Jack Hammer contain the Fixadine to bring back to the Resistance</span><br><br><color Paragon>Help the Resistance</color><br>Jack Hammer intends to use the Fixadine to give the Resistance control over a number of Destroyers. It's doubtful that this will go unnoticed by the Loyalists - you'll need to defend this position incase any PPD show up!<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3733639569" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Trade the Fixadine</color></scale><br>Use this Fixadine stash to get yourself a high position in the Loyalists</span><br><br><color orange>Help the Loyalists</color><br>You did the hard work of breaking through the PPD to get in here, why should the Resistance benefit? You could turn on Jack Hammer and bring this stash back under Loyalist control, all while using this to 'convince' Marauder to get you a high position within the Loyalists.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

